Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:10.94,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,It's raining. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.13,Default,I,0000,0000,0000,,It's raining. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:17.50,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,But I'll try my best, even in the rain! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:19.08,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get more candy! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:28.31,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,That was close. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:34.24,Default,I,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:39.81,Default,I,0000,0000,0000,,It's your fault I'm all muddy! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:17.43,Default,Ke,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay if you're muddy, Ioryogi. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:19.70,Default,Ke,0000,0000,0000,,The rain will wash it right off. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:24.47,Default,I,0000,0000,0000,,No it's not! Then I'll be soaked! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.91,0:02:26.12,Default,Sa,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.97,0:02:31.21,Default,Ko,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:33.09,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.70,0:02:40.22,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Miss Sayaka? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:41.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:43.72,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we going? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.47,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,To your place. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.36,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:03:01.81,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Can I really live here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:04.91,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:07.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:08.31,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:18.72,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Let me introduce you. This is Chitose, my friend and the manager of these apartments. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:21.76,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Pleased to meet you. I'm Hanato Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:26.76,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, huh. Good to meet you, I'm Mihara Chitose. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:31.40,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,If there's anything you don't know or have trouble with, feel free to ask. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.57,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:35.02,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose, you take care of the rest. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:37.15,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Later, Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:39.17,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going back to the nursery. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:40.71,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.71,0:03:42.44,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a ton! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:44.62,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'll come help out later. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:49.05,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka always worries so much about other people. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.53,0:03:51.53,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:52.87,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:54.65,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad to meet you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:58.25,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,She seems so kind. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:00.92,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be leeching here for now, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:05.39,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Hanato Kobato! I'll be helping out here from today on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:07.66,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You're not the one helping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:10.97,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,So, when will your things arrive? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:12.52,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:15.07,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,This is it! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:17.00,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What about your mattress and stuff? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:18.22,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have one! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.81,0:04:19.70,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.10,0:04:22.79,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let me show you around then. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.54,0:04:24.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:28.24,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What a wonderful building this is. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:30.12,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:36.71,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,This is a wonderful room, Ioryogi. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:39.26,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:42.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Huhhhh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:45.00,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Where'd he go? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:53.89,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:56.32,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You left me behind again! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:05:00.23,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you!? I'm a stuffed animal here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:02.48,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.71,0:05:04.08,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:07.59,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:09.02,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,All right... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:12.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery class is starting. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:15.68,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:21.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't hurry, I'll be late! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:29.43,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! Are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:33.43,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine. But what about him? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:37.86,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, he's all muddy now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.45,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,He's so cute! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:45.48,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,All right, nice and clean. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:47.74,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Here ya go. See ya. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.57,0:05:51.56,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:54.79,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Welp, she's got more sense than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:02.79,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, what did you think of your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:06.34,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's wonderful having a roof I can relax under. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:09.07,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's nice. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:13.23,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.06,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:18.32,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm cleaning now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:20.21,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll help out! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:21.69,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Us too! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.69,0:06:23.57,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:25.89,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.89,0:06:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.26,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,How about me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:32.20,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you even have to set her up with an apartment? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:36.04,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Well, everyone's so happy now that she's here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:38.07,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tease her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:45.41,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,How many times do you plan on getting hurt like that? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:51.52,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You're right. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:57.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, we have to be on our guard against anyone. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:03.81,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad it's stopped raining. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:09.90,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,There's no class at the nursery today, so I can go collect more candy! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:25.82,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Man, it was sunny up until now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:28.32,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to bring an umbrella. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:30.00,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:36.58,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't look like it's gonna stop soon. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:39.03,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,We're just gonna have to get soaked. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:42.28,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Why does it have to be just me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:45.40,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you have an umbrella? 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.13,0:07:47.13,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Nope... 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:49.06,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:52.99,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead and use it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:56.26,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,But... 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:08:01.08,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead, I keep it around for customers. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:06.21,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring it back when it stops raining! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.43,0:08:10.09,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. I'll be waiting. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:12.58,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:19.01,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,That was pretty up-front for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.61,0:08:21.62,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,All right, just like that. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.02,0:08:22.93,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:26.94,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'll collect information on people that want to be healed here! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:29.69,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.69,0:08:31.97,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,People keep coming and going here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:36.72,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:48.74,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't find anything out. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.87,0:08:51.96,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:54.03,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,The umbrella I borrowed is gone! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:54.97,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:58.26,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Did someone take the wrong one? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:00.60,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,They probably just walked off with it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:04.21,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Can people just go and do that? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:05.87,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,No way! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:13.96,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man... And I had borrowed it from the baker... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:16.71,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:20.03,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,It's you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:22.51,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,It's you from yesterday. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:23.54,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What's up? 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:25.85,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I lost my umbrella... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.60,0:09:31.21,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Here! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:35.01,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You can have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:36.32,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,But... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:37.27,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.27,0:09:39.20,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I live right near here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:42.64,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,And he'll get all wet without one, too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:46.31,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Tadokoro! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:54.32,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,If you just keep buying and eating you're gonna get fat again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:10:00.26,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! You're an idiot, Katsuragi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:01.96,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:02.77,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Um... 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.84,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.84,0:10:06.61,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't wait, I'm gonna smack you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:09.21,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!? You will even if I wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:12.29,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Katsuragi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:18.30,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,So there's people who would give up their umbrella even if it means they get wet... 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:37.11,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.11,0:10:39.63,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:41.62,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:45.79,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You've got tatami marks on your cheek. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.84,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Later! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:59.12,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,How embarassing! Having tatami marks on my cheek. Chitose must think I'm so weird. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:04.89,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:05.68,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.22,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the umbrella! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:11.97,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,So you found my school. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:20.60,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. When I went to apologize to the baker I'd borrowed the umbrella from, he picked it out by your green uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:24.00,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi says thanks too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:25.73,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.19,0:11:29.01,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you mean this stuffed animal? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:31.96,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What a funny name. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:35.21,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm called Hanato Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:37.64,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Tadokoro Mutsumi. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:38.71,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Tadokoro! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:43.68,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Your hair's sticking up in back! 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:46.68,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! I don't need you to tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.47,0:11:48.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:50.36,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:55.56,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I had a tatami print on my cheek this morning. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:59.55,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to imitate that. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.82,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry... 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.15,0:12:04.53,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:06.75,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I've got morning practice, so{\fscx200}-{\fscx100} 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:14.21,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, that boy before was mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:16.75,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,He's just like Fujimoto. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.98,0:12:21.04,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,If I'm late, he'll be even meaner. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:29.11,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You're one minute and 23 seconds late. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:32.02,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,One minute? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.26,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's one minute, you're still late. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:36.35,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:40.46,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,It's because you slept in until the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:43.61,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,The tatami print is going away. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:45.57,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You must've slipped off your mattress. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:48.26,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have a mattress!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:51.70,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,'Morning, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:55.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.18,0:12:58.56,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Did Fujimoto say something to you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:13:00.77,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Well, um... 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:05.11,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,He's a bit blunt, but he's not a bad guy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:07.93,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,But if he's mean to you any more, tell me. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:10.57,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give him a good spanking! {video}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.57,0:13:12.85,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Spanking? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:15.87,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, like the old days. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:17.71,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,The old days? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:21.39,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! It's finally sunny. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.67,0:13:23.61,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,We can dry the nap blankets. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:26.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I'll do that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:31.90,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye, Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.90,0:13:34.91,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.93,0:13:40.42,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it's going to rain again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:42.59,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, where's your umbrella? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:44.26,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have one. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:48.07,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's still here, you can walk home with him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:52.93,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I still have stuff to do. Just take my umbrella. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:55.27,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to share one with you anyway. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.92,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Sharing an umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:02.11,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Where you have two people under one umbrella. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:08.28,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka was right. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:11.23,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,It really is raining. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:26.66,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,The person who took it by accident brought it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:29.51,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:31.26,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:33.75,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Tadokoro Mutsumi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.75,0:14:36.52,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Just call me Mutsumi. What's up? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:38.94,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,The umbrella came back! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.51,0:14:43.15,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I see. That's great. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:47.17,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Shopping again, Mutsumi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:52.03,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, kendo team practice is so tough I'm starving by the end of it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.03,0:14:54.38,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You seem like you're trying hard. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:56.27,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,But... 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:15:00.31,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,If I eat too much, I'll get fat. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:02.17,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Here, have these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:04.00,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Can I? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.13,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, go ahead. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:07.55,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Later! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:34.24,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,So that's sharing an umbrella. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:42.90,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:16:00.32,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi looked so sad. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:04.35,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how I could cheer her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.77,0:16:08.40,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno. Maybe more of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:13.94,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:16.03,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Open up! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:20.78,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:29.44,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.44,0:16:32.95,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Sorry about the racket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:37.27,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Pleased to meet you. I'm the manager's daughter, Chiho. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:38.47,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Chise. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:41.78,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Pleased to meet you. I'm Hanato Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:44.02,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have a mattress, do you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:45.55,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Right. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.55,0:16:48.90,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Mama said you could use this. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.37,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:53.13,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's used. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.09,0:16:55.59,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, see you later! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:58.24,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.41,0:17:04.21,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,They gave me a mattress. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:07.33,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You're not the one that's supposed to be getting healed! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:10.17,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's right. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:13.87,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm supposed to be making Mutsumi happy again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:15.27,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,But how? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:18.54,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know, but I'll try my best! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:24.60,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! What are you gonna do? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:29.67,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's best to leave her alone for now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:35.62,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.69,0:17:40.15,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to talk with you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:42.48,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,About Mutsumi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.59,0:17:50.13,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Please! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.27,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:57.62,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Well... I'd like you to share an umbrella with Mutsumi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.42,0:18:01.97,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Please! 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:06.06,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Why with her? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:08.04,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:15.20,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:18.17,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What's all this about? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:25.40,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Lately, you've looked so sad... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:32.50,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,When you shared an umbrella with other girls. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.79,0:18:36.46,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.21,0:18:38.81,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Then why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:41.28,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Well... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.81,0:18:45.17,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Well... 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:12.53,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry if I'm overdoing it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:17.52,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I just want Mutsumi to be happy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.91,0:19:21.09,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,So... 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:22.94,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:25.76,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Please share an umbrella with Mutsumi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.97,0:19:28.43,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:30.00,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Please! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:36.45,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that being mean to the new girl? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:45.88,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Get under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.36,0:19:49.50,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What? I told you, I'm fine! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:53.75,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going out with that other girl. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:20:01.49,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I just walked with her because she forgot her umbrella. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.57,0:20:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There you go, Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Katsuragi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.67,0:20:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on! I'm getting wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.52,0:20:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.62,0:20:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too cramped!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:44.35,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,But it really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Complain all you want, it's still a small umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:50.58,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Mutsumi doesn't look too happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.17,0:20:53.46,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,They're fine like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.34,0:20:55.67,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:20.87,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,It's funny, Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:22.69,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:25.89,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting more candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.57,0:21:30.05,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,That's why you healed that girl, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.51,0:21:36.69,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,I just helped out because I wanted her to cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.51,0:21:44.44,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what you were trying to do, you healed her scarred heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:46.13,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.13,0:21:49.27,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Getting more candy is the best proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.45,0:21:52.83,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.05,0:21:57.77,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.77,0:22:07.18,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What's this atmosphere?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.82,0:22:09.63,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.17,0:22:14.50,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's nothing, Shuichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.53,0:22:16.56,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:24.32,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,You somehow got it right this time, so you can have a good score.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.62,0:22:26.31,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Really!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:33.19,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Ioryogi!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:38.83,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.15,0:22:41.33,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,Zero points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:47.89,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,That's so mean, Ioryogi! You said I scored well!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.89,0:22:51.37,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,It's your fault that I'm covered in mud and ink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.37,0:22:54.82,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay if you're muddy! The rain will wash it right off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.82,0:22:57.27,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,The rain won't wash away my rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.27,0:22:59.47,Default,--,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.06,0:00:51.94,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:01:00.24,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:10.04,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:15.84,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:23.60,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:29.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.27,0:01:34.49,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.49,0:01:40.78,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.78,0:01:46.46,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:53.17,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.17,0:02:01.89,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(918,1001)\pos(424,166)}... Gift of the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:07.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.53,0:23:15.37,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.95,0:23:23.38,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:32.01,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:43.02,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.40,0:23:45.73,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.27,0:23:54.16,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:24:01.25,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.04,0:24:10.76,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.84,0:24:14.93,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:28.07,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.06,0:24:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(540,388)}... Pulsing leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.06,0:24:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(538,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
